  FAC.LST               the program as LISTed by Atari BASIC, from the disk
                        image 2_92.atr in 2_92_listingi.zip of the unofficial
                        "Tajemnice Atari" electronic archive (Pixel, 2001,
                        http://tajemnice.atari8.info/2_92/)
  FAC.bas               the same listing as UTF-8 text taken from the HTML
                        article (lossy: control characters and the charset
                        DATA lines are missing, see fac_extract.py --check)
  2_92_fac.html         the magazine article containing the listing, as
                        published by the archive
  levels.txt, meta.json the levels, parameters, colours and the tune from the
  fac/data/*            listing
  charset.bin           the 26 glyphs from DATA lines 1010..1140
  docs/*.png            screenshots rendered from the original graphics

The intro text and the menu of the original use the Atari 8-bit OS character
set, which is (C) Atari and is deliberately not part of this repository; see
--os-font in fac/play.py.

If you are a rights holder and object to the inclusion of any of this material,
please open an issue and it will be removed.
